# The published list of the criteria of a constructor's field (com.yang_bo.gezi.standardlibrary.FieldCriterion): parameter, the
# criterion's parameter of its one field, an integer; recursive, the family itself, of no field; closed, the closed
# criterion of its one field, the list of the head term and its arguments.
# A Scott sum whose constructors are the tuple's fields, in the order of the enum's cases, read by position. A
# knowledge file writes a constructor, imported from this file or written closed (the two are one term), as an item
# of the list of a member of its slot fields, and KnowledgeFileReading reads which alternative it takes by structure,
# never by a name: the host reads no string.
λ export
. (λtuple. tuple λindex parameter recursive closed. parameter index)
λ parameter
. (λtuple. tuple λparameter recursive closed. recursive)
λ recursive
. (λtuple. tuple λterms parameter recursive closed. closed terms)
λ closed
. export parameter recursive closed
